cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this trainer or its evaluation protocol, cite this repository."
title: "zimo-lm: a small character-level GPT-2 language model trainer"
abstract: >-
  A minimal, from-scratch GPT-2-style character-level language model trainer
  with a live dashboard, a self-contained static report, corpus preparation,
  and an offline candidate-reranking evaluator.  Intended as a reproducible
  baseline for small Chinese language models and IME candidate scoring.
authors:
  - name: "Zimo contributors"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
license: MIT
